# Migrate AI SDK 5.x to 6.0
## [Providers](https://ai-sdk.dev/docs/migration-guides/migration-guide-6-0#providers)
### [Google Vertex](https://ai-sdk.dev/docs/migration-guides/migration-guide-6-0#google-vertex)
#### [`providerMetadata` and `providerOptions` Key](https://ai-sdk.dev/docs/migration-guides/migration-guide-6-0#providermetadata-and-provideroptions-key)
```
import { vertex } from '@ai-sdk/google-vertex';
import { generateText } from 'ai';

const result = await generateText({
  model: vertex('gemini-2.5-flash'),
  providerOptions: {
    vertex: {
      safetySettings: [\
        /* ... */\
      ],
    }, // Now uses 'vertex' key
  },
  prompt: 'Hello',
});

// Access metadata via 'vertex' key
console.log(result.providerMetadata?.vertex?.safetyRatings);
```
